        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International Gibraltar Appliance Pull Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Gibraltar Appliance Pull is uniquely suited for adding luxury detail to your home. This RK International Gibraltar Appliance Pull Collection is available in 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. Each pull comes packaged as a complete set with all the required mounting hardware to mount it on an appliance panel. The Gibraltar Refrigerator Handle is made with luxury appliances in mind, with high quality construction and amazing finish color options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/gibraltar-cabinet-pull-series-rk-international-cp-825\"><b>Gibraltar Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/gibraltar-t-knob-rk-international-ck-725\"><b>Gibraltar Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-8825</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-8826</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
